    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Ready to face the horrors of the night?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong><br>Jacob, a security guard, goes to an apartment building that was abandoned years ago after a complaint from neighbors. The neighbors complain about strange noises coming from the apartment. Jacob enters the apartment to investigate the scene, but someone locks the door on him. Our character starts looking for a way out and starts to experience paranormal events inside. He sees that the door of an apartment is open and enters, but is locked inside again. At this point, Jacob realizes that something is going on in the apartment and continues his investigations. He learns that a family has disappeared from the apartment. Jacob's wife Sophie died in a traffic accident 10 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727810/extras/73030cb5c4054e14d1a8d4bef6577bc5.poster.avif?t=1750543068\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727810/extras/73030cb5c4054e14d1a8d4bef6577bc5.webm?t=1750543068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727810/extras/73030cb5c4054e14d1a8d4bef6577bc5.mp4?t=1750543068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Forgotten Apartment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The echoes of the past still whisper through the walls...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an abandoned apartment, what awaits you in the dark corners?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Forgotten Apartment</strong> offers a short yet intense experience built on forgotten memories, psychological tension, and repressed fears.<br>This is not a walking simulator\u2014this is an awakening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Every room whispers a dark secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleverly Designed Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Piece together the past to recover your lost memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A One-Hour Cinematic Experience</strong> \u2013 Short but unforgettable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Quality Graphics &amp; Sound Design</strong> \u2013 Every detail is crafted to pull you in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The past hasn\u2019t forgotten you.<br>Are you ready to face it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727810/extras/094ca3156c9d64eee0169750422f64d2.poster.avif?t=1750543068\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727810/extras/094ca3156c9d64eee0169750422f64d2.webm?t=1750543068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727810/extras/094ca3156c9d64eee0169750422f64d2.mp4?t=1750543068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Ready to face the horrors of the night?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong><br>Jacob, a security guard, goes to an apartment building that was abandoned years ago after a complaint from neighbors. The neighbors complain about strange noises coming from the apartment. Jacob enters the apartment to investigate the scene, but someone locks the door on him. Our character starts looking for a way out and starts to experience paranormal events inside. He sees that the door of an apartment is open and enters, but is locked inside again. At this point, Jacob realizes that something is going on in the apartment and continues his investigations. He learns that a family has disappeared from the apartment. Jacob's wife Sophie died in a traffic accident 10 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727810/extras/73030cb5c4054e14d1a8d4bef6577bc5.poster.avif?t=1750543068\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727810/extras/73030cb5c4054e14d1a8d4bef6577bc5.webm?t=1750543068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727810/extras/73030cb5c4054e14d1a8d4bef6577bc5.mp4?t=1750543068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Forgotten Apartment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The echoes of the past still whisper through the walls...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an abandoned apartment, what awaits you in the dark corners?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Forgotten Apartment</strong> offers a short yet intense experience built on forgotten memories, psychological tension, and repressed fears.<br>This is not a walking simulator\u2014this is an awakening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Every room whispers a dark secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleverly Designed Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Piece together the past to recover your lost memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A One-Hour Cinematic Experience</strong> \u2013 Short but unforgettable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Quality Graphics &amp; Sound Design</strong> \u2013 Every detail is crafted to pull you in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The past hasn\u2019t forgotten you.<br>Are you ready to face it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727810/extras/094ca3156c9d64eee0169750422f64d2.poster.avif?t=1750543068\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727810/extras/094ca3156c9d64eee0169750422f64d2.webm?t=1750543068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727810/extras/094ca3156c9d64eee0169750422f64d2.mp4?t=1750543068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
